  "source": "book/assets/mage-dynamic-model.svg",
  "claim": "*The MAGE Dynamic Model.* Prior engineering knowledge seeds the governed engineering environment (GEE). Work orders specify intended changes, agentic capacity enables their implementation, and the GEE governs attempted work. Observed problems can prompt diagnosis and governance adaptation, revising the environment inherited by later work. An improved GEE may also support more ambitious tasks, exposing new demands on its representations and controls.",
